{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"🏡 Player made buildings, Roanoke","id":"740291949843447869","name":"leafs-lookout","position":80,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf wakes up in a spasm of movement. Eyes shoot open. One leg kicks out against the inside of the tree. Still there. One hand on her symbol. Still there. Another hand shoots to her face. Okay, still there. She lurches forward and rolls out of the tree, landing face first in the soft grass. Still there. She rolls over on her back where she can look up and see the underside of Mello's basin in the tree. Leaf lets out an audible sigh of relief. Still there.","created_at":"2020-08-06T16:44:56.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740973698034434118","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Groggily, Leaf sits up in the grass and is reminded of the nightmares she had back in forests near London. Nights full of fitful sleep, running from goblin hunters and adventures in and outside her head. She puts her head sleepily in her hands, trying to reassure herself that dreams like these won't chase her. She leans back against the tree and hopes the morning sun will help wake her up.","created_at":"2020-08-06T16:54:56.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740976216248418416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"(on break from my orientation thing so here's what Leaf is doing) Leaf spent most of the afternoon happily gathering supplies to build a platform at the top of her tree. She does her best to build out from the branches, allowing the tree itself to guide the shape.","created_at":"2020-08-06T22:59:52.773000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T05:02:09.251000Z","id":"741068055345627256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"The nightmares continue rattling around her head, making it hard to focus throughout the day. She struggles with the tools borrowed from Fabertell, having only ever watched people use them from afar. After an entire day's work, Leaf sits atop a simple wooden platform overlooking the RTG's (now TTG's?) tree cul de sac.","created_at":"2020-08-07T05:09:28.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741161068629590076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
