{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf shakes her head and smiles sadly. \"I think I just need to stop being scared. I don't know why I thought it would be easier to go not knowing things. Instead it just ate at me. The not knowing.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T07:35:04.202000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T07:35:27.635000Z","id":"741197707275927562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra reaches towards the spider while looking to Leaf. \"Much change. No know all. No bad not knowing. If want know, why no ask? Then Leaf know. No be scared.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T07:37:29.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741198316829671466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
