{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf takes a breath, holding it for a moment. \"I- I don't know. What if what I find out is worse than what I think? I don't want to know something like that. But then if things weren't as bad as I was worried about... Then...\" She pulls her knees to her chest. \"Then I thought something awful about the only family I have...\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T07:42:21.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741199540660731925","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra  moves over and wraps an arm around around Leaf. \"Bad thinks happen, like... bad dreams. Much when scared. No mean like less. Or Leaf let go. Some things to messy to worry, worry bring more fear, and just make big circle.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T07:47:54.361000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T07:48:00.768000Z","id":"741200937556639775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf nods, \"That's all it was. A big dumb circle. A circle with secrets, and whispering and *stupid* notes left on my bed.\" She's starting to get a bit heated now. \"I didn't ask for this. For people to trust me. But then suddenly things start happening and people think they can just tell me half truths without any explanation and expect me not to worry.\" A part of her tells her to stop but the exhaustion takes over and she continues anyway, getting a bit louder now. \"What did Castor think was going to happen!? Telling me not to trust Ebuc and Web. Saying they were part of the Dawn. Then calls me young and says I don't have to be a part of things.\" She scoffs \"It was already too late for that. That's what I mean. You can't take back knowledge. Once you know, or think you know something, it's *there*. You can't take it out.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:02:57.351000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T08:08:25.201000Z","id":"741204724971208734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra  makes no attempts to calm Leaf down. \"No take back. But forget may be? Detective Fleshling much wierd. All time. All way from London. Some time he say thing, no think about words. Some time he say one thing but mean other. Baeshra no know what he say make Leaf mad. No know why mo trust Clankers or Web. Detective Fleshling no like Web on fish-boat, but no not like now.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:10:45.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741206689537327104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"But it wasn't just Castor! Suddenly I was running around casting Zone of Truth to try and get people to talk. All the whispering and hiding in rooms. I *followed* Ebuc. Without him knowing.\" Both hands clutch her head now. \"I told myself I wouldn't do things like that anymore! And then I talked to him but not Web. I don't know why! Daysong just asked me so I did! And then casting Command on Goan, I was *terrified*. I didn't know who I was putting in danger or upsetting. I just wanted answers, and for people to stop *whispering* all the time. And at the end of it all I still didn't understand Goan's letter! I still have no idea what happened with Castor, or Wynne or Web or Ebuc or Goan or Amara or- any of it!\" Her eyes are tightly shut, as if in physical pain at letting everything out.","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:20:00.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741209017233440769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web walks near the treehouse, pausing as their eyes glaze over to look through their spider's senses. Their eyes focus back in on the world, but Web shakes their head. Something is wrong. They blink several times, or attempt to. They cannot, as the flesh surrounding their eyes has turned to stone. Web holds up a hand in front of their vision, trying to strain their eyes to squint at the increasingly blurry forms in front of them. As they squint their eyes begin to turn a sad shade of grey, fixing in place. They touch their fingertip to their eyes, feeling the cold texture of stone. They can feel the sensation of wishing to cry, but cannot. Their tear ducts have solidified. \"Leaf? Baeshra?\" They yell frantically","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:20:57.161000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741209254022742097","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra  pulls Leaf into to a hug. \"Leaf no need find answers alone. Leaf trust tribe? Tribe trust Leaf. No need hide. Leaf say many things Baeshra no know. Baeshra help much as Baeshra can. No want Leaf fight for answers on own.\" Baeshra subconsciously pats Leaf's back then perks her head up. \"Web?!\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:25:32.254000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741210407846281236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
